#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how quantum computers can efficiently solve problems, including "
"searching and factoring, faster than classical computers."
msgstr ""
"Pelajari bagaimana komputer kuantum bisa menyelesaikan masalah secara "
"efisien, termasuk pencarian dan faktorisasi, lebih cepat dari komputer "
"klasik."

