#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Fundamentals of quantum algorithms, take the exam at "
"IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the "
"lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by "
"Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mendapatkan badge kamu untuk Fundamentals of quantum algorithms, ikuti"
" ujian di IBM&reg; Training. Ujian ini dimaksudkan untuk diambil setelah "
"membaca pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Setelah kamu lulus ujian, kamu akan "
"diberi tahu oleh Credly bahwa kamu telah mendapatkan badge.\n"

